:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Bath Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-kylar-bathroom-link'>>
  <<if $kylar_sleep_abduction is 1 and $KylarExpansion.stay_invited>>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink ["Bathroom (0:01)", "浴室 (0:01)"] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bathroom'>><<pass 1>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bathroom []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You leave the closed bathroom door alone.' '你没有擅自推开紧闭的浴室门。'>>
<<else>>
  <<if Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 23 and $KylarExpansion.bath_day isnot Time.days
    and maplebirch.get('Kylar').atManor>>
    <<set $KylarExpansion.bath_day to Time.days>>
    <<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to random(1, 2) is 1>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>The manor bathroom sits off the front hall. The old pipes knock faintly behind the wall, and someone has left a folded towel on the shelf outside the door.
    <<option 'CN'>>庄园浴室就在门厅旁。旧水管在墙后轻轻作响，门外的搁板上有人留了一条叠好的毛巾。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Kylar').canMeetInBath>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Water is already running. Kylar calls your name from behind the closed door.' '里面已经响起水声。凯拉尔隔着紧闭的门叫了你的名字。'>><br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Answer Kylar', '回应凯拉尔'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Meeting'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink ['Wait, then bathe (0:40)', '等凯拉尔洗完再洗 (0:40)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash'>><<pass 40>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink ['Bathe alone (0:20)', '独自洗浴 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回门厅'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>><<wash>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>>
<<lanSwitch 'The pipes rattle as you wash, but the water stays warm. You dry yourself and put your clothes back on.' '你洗浴时水管仍在轻响，水却一直很暖。你擦干身体，重新穿好衣服。'>><<clotheson>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回门厅'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Meeting []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('Kylar').canMeetInBath>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar has finished bathing and gone back to the bedroom.' '凯拉尔已经洗完，回到房间去了。'>>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Kylar opens the door a crack after you answer. "I heard you in the hall. I thought you were leaving." <<He>> pulls the towel closer around <<his>> shoulders, looking past you towards the front door.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你应声后，凯拉尔才把门打开一条缝。“我听见你在门厅里。我还以为你要走了。”<<He>>裹紧肩上的毛巾，越过你看向大门。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Tell Kylar you are not leaving yet', '告诉凯拉尔你还没打算走'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Reassure'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar')>>
    <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Ask to stay with Kylar', '问凯拉尔能否留下'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave Kylar to bathe', '让凯拉尔继续洗浴'] 'Manor Hall'>><<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Reassure []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Kylar').canMeetInBath>>
  <<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tell Kylar you only came to use the bathroom. "Oh. Right." <<He>> looks at you, then points to the dry towel on the shelf. "I put that there for you. Don't use the other one."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你告诉凯拉尔，你只是过来洗澡。“哦。这样啊。”<<He>>看了看你，又指向搁板上的干毛巾。“那是给你放的。别拿另一条。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have already said what you came to say.' '你想说的话已经说过了。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回门厅'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('Kylar').canMeetInBath or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have already finished here. There is nothing more to do.' '你已经收拾好了。这里没有别的事可做。'>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You ask whether Kylar wants you to stay.
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        <<He>> grips the door frame. "You mean it? You're not just saying that?" <<He>> looks past you into the hall, then steps back. "Stay with me."
      <<else>>
        <<He>> blinks, then steps aside to make room. "If— if you want to," <<he>> says. <<He>> waits for your answer, looking at you rather than away.
      <</if>>
      Water drips from <<his>> hair onto the towel. <<He>> keeps watching you, one hand still on the door.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问凯拉尔是否愿意让你留下。
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        <<He>>攥住门框。“真的？你不是随口说说吧？”<<He>>越过你看向门厅，随后退开一步。“留下来陪我。”
      <<else>>
        <<He>>愣了一下，随后挪开身体。“你、你想的话。”<<he>>说。<<He>>看着你，没有再移开视线，等你回答。
      <</if>>
      水从<<his>>发梢滴到毛巾上。<<He>>一直看着你，一只手仍搭在门上。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink ['Bathe together (0:20)', '一起洗浴 (0:20)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Kiss Kylar', '吻凯拉尔'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<strip>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Kylar' 'kiss'>><br>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave it there', '到此为止'] 'Manor Hall'>><<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>>
<<npc Kylar>><<person1>><<wash>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Kylar makes room for you by the tap and steadies the loose shower head while you wash.
    <span class='lewd'><<He>> keeps finding excuses to touch you — a hand at your shoulder, then your hip. When you look around, <<he>> blushes without quite taking <<his>> hand away.</span>
    When you finish, <<he>> offers you the towel <<he>> set aside.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    凯拉尔在水龙头旁为你腾出地方。你洗浴时，<<he>>帮你扶着松动的淋浴喷头。
    <span class='lewd'><<He>>不断找借口碰你——手搭上你的肩，又滑到腰侧。你回头看过去，<<he>>红了脸，手却没有完全收回去。</span>
    洗完后，<<he>>递来先前为你留的毛巾。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>><<stress -3>><<lstress>><<clotheson>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回门厅'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Kylar>>
<</if>>
<<person1>>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>><<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
  <<set $enemytrust += 100>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You kiss Kylar. <<He>> drops the towel onto the dry shelf and presses closer, one hand closing around your waist.
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        "You came here for me," <<he>> whispers against your lips. "Didn't you?" <<He>> draws back just enough to see your face.
      <<else>>
        "I— I can stop," <<he>> says, then adds much too quickly: "Not that I want to. Unless you do. Sorry." <<He>> watches your face, red to the ears.
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你吻上凯拉尔。<<He>>把毛巾丢到干燥的搁板上，贴得更近，一只手环住你的腰。
      <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>>
        “你是来找我的。”<<he>>贴着你的嘴唇低声说，“对吧？”<<He>>稍稍退开，看着你的脸。
      <<else>>
        “我、我可以停。”<<he>>说，又急急忙忙补上一句：“不是我想停。除非你想。对不起。”<<He>>看着你的脸，连耳根都红了。
      <</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $enemyanger to -10>>
<<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
<br><br><<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ["Next", '继续'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ["Next", '继续'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy Finish []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bath_encounter to false>>
<<person1>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<ejaculation>><<npcincr Kylar lust -20>><<lllust>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar stays pressed against you while <<his>> breathing slows, and does not pull away from the mess between you. When the water begins to cool, <<he>> finds the towel and asks whether you are comfortable, still flushed from what <<he>> just did.' '凯拉尔贴着你不肯动，呼吸慢慢平下来，也没有躲开你们之间那片狼藉。水渐渐凉了，<<he>>才拿起毛巾，红着脸问你还好吗。'>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love -2>><<llove>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar recoils and asks you to stop. You step back and give <<him>> room to leave.' '凯拉尔退开，请你停下。你让出空间，等<<he>>先离开。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You stop. Kylar passes you a towel and waits while you catch your breath.' '你停了下来。凯拉尔把毛巾递给你，等你平复呼吸。'>>
<</if>>
<<wash>><<clotheson>><<endcombat>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回门厅'] 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>
